Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:42.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《异形魔怪3》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.85,0:00:56.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿根廷恰可平原）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:09.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（完美镇）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:17.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（正牌突袭蟒）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:25.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（最冷的啤酒）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:32.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（房地产销售处）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.19,0:06:36.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（完美谷牧场）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.16,0:22:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别嚼了 快把嘴里的东西吐掉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.17,0:22:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.17,0:23:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快找个东西丢出去
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.00,0:53:30.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（食物大卖场）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.42,1:15:32.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（完美谷牧场预定地）
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.10,1:17:50.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（使用中）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,290 280{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}290. 280.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之所以会站在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Si mI amiga. We are completamente seguros here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是经过我仔细选择的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I've selected my position carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.22,0:02:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗的第一原则 了解你的敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First rule of engagement: Know your enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.43,0:02:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二原则 懂得在何处与他交战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second rule: Know where to engage him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续让引擎转动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've kept your engines running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.95,0:02:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要它们释放出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want maximum heat emissions…from these coordinates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.89,0:02:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,最大的热力来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mucho caliente. Comprende?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.23,0:02:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间 清晨五点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time, 5:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.69,0:02:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,地点 恰可平原南方七公里处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place, seven klicks south of EI Chaco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.96,0:02:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The situation:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.64,0:02:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,两星期前曾接到报告 附近有一条突袭蟒活动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A single graboid reported in the area two weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.51,0:02:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去十一年中 突袭蟒共出现过三次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The third appearance of these underground carnivores in the last 11 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于地方当局的疏失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, lack of action on the part of locaI authorities…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,使怪兽得以变形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has allowed the creature to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今它已进入 第二阶段的生命周期中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}metamorphose…into the second stage of its life cycle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.98,0:03:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,已创造出六支尖叫兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}producing six shriekers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.98,0:03:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一种贪婪的双性动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a voracious, hermaphroditic life-form…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有充足的食物 它每几分钟就能复制一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which can double in number every few minutes by eating sufficient food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.99,0:03:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,以今天来讲 它们的食物是鸡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this case, chickens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,满满一卡车的鸡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A truckload of chickens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在红外线监视器 侦测到一群尖叫兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Infrared monitoring now indicates the shrieker herd…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,正越过彭巴斯草原向我们接近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}moving across the pampas toward us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离我们将近300米{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}closing at less than 300 meters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我利用战斗上的技巧 引导尖叫兽群离开人口聚集处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've managed to lead the shrieker herd away from civilian population.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所使用的战技包括坐牛酋长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My tacticaI approach is utilize various maneuvers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.24,0:03:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在小大角羊河之役的技巧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}demonstrated by Sitting Bull at Little Bighorn…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,和第二次世界大战中 隆美尔北非之役的战法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Field MarshaI RommeI during the North Africa campaign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.03,0:03:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的是要建立一个适当的屠宰区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea being to set up a proper kill zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便提一下它们的作战技巧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should take this opportunity to point out their zero tacticaI skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于没有眼睛和耳朵 它们只能感觉到热能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lacking eyes or ears, they can sense only heat and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友们 要有耐心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience, mI amigo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就不用担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to worry about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.07,0:04:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这次我有最合适的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because for once I have the proper tooI at hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在找热能吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for a little heat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.14,0:05:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么问题？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any questions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.26,0:06:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 欢迎你回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, welcome home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.20,0:06:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在电视上 看到你开炮的英姿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw you on CNN shooting that cannon thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,双管点五零的高射炮真过瘾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}DuaI.50 antiaircraft turret mount.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,米格 真高兴见到你 那是什么鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you, Miguel. What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是雷诺来的房地产商 他们想分割整个山谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some reaI estate guys out of Reno. They want to cut up the valley into parceIs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在做梦 - 我也是这么说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That'll be a cold day in hell. - That's what I told them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你离开时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, while you were gone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.22,0:07:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多的水泥卡车开到你家去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was this conga line of cement trucks going up to your place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在建什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you building up there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.22,0:07:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在建突袭蟒的地底路障 是我自己设计的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I installed an underground graboid barrier, my own design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个包上钢的大水泥箱 有两英尺厚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big cement box, two-feet thick, steeI reinforced…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,建在地下 围绕着整个房子的地基{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}completely surrounding my compound…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在终于能安心睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sides and bottom. Now I can sleep nights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,都已经过了十一年了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Burt. What's it been, 11 years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.24,0:07:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不能掉以轻心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reason to lower your guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.26,0:07:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, welcome home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.47,0:07:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要装电脑条码机吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put in a bar code reader?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.27,0:07:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能用它来建立 我的购买档案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jodi, they can use that to build a profile on all my purchases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 欢迎回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, welcome home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:08:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 下一次 他们会问我要DNA样品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, welcome. Next they'll want a sample of my DNA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How have you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还可以吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm getting by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还可以？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting by?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干的比你叔叔要好得多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing better than your uncle ever did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.29,0:08:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,经营零售业 若不能夺得先机 就活不下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In retail, if you're not three steps ahead, you're one step behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要看信吗？好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want your mail? Yeah, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.80,0:08:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「完美谷牧场」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfection Valley Ranchettes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.30,0:08:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已向所有的人出价了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been making offers to all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我替你归档吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I file it for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.97,0:08:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好酷的表 是那些阿根廷人送给我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}CooI watch. Gift from the gauchos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是利用超音波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It continuously updates its time to the nanosecond…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接与科罗拉多的铯原子钟连接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by connecting directly to the cesium clock in Colorado…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确度高达十亿分之一秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}via uItrasonic frequency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,超出人耳的范围 只有狗耳能听到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well above our normaI range of hearing, but it'll give a dog fits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.47,0:08:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有帮我带一些突袭蟒 或尖叫兽的尸块回来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. So, were you able to get me graboid or shrieker parts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,像嘴 触须或爪子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beaks, tentacles, claws?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:09:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的似乎有点过份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you overdoing all this a little?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.11,0:09:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西会让我们名气大增{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, this stuff is our claim to fame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.95,0:09:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国有熊猫 澳洲有无尾熊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}China has pandas. Australia has koalas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们有这家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've got these…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是绝种也没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if they are extinct here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想把山谷变成主题乐园吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to turn the valley into a theme park?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友不就搞得有声有色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked for your friends, EarI and Grady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.90,0:09:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是为过活而动脑筋罢了 可是这…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just fighting for my piece of the leisure dollar. But this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.36,0:09:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你所谓的 主题乐园的标准人选{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is your theme park kind of guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,「杰克沙漠突袭蟒探险团 终生难忘的巨兽经验」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Desert Jack's Graboid Adventure, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是何方神圣？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who the hell is this yahoo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你离开时他搬到这里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He moved in while you were gone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始带观光客 作突袭蟒探险的生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}started this business…taking people out on graboid safaris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.37,0:09:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定要相信 各位先生女士们 一切都是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it, ladies and gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里并不是模拟的主题乐园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no theme park simulation here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们正置身在 突袭蟒的中心点上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in the heart of graboid country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.29,0:09:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些地下猛兽 这些为生存而战的居民们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These savage subterrestriaIs…these death-dealing denizens of dirt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.76,0:09:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在十一年前首度在此对抗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}first appeared about 11 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别眨眼 随时要准备行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you keep your eyes peeled, your mind and body centered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些怪兽随时会跳出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things can jump up at any moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.07,0:10:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕 只是长耳野兔罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a jackrabbit, folks. Just a jackrabbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.40,0:10:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,深呼吸然后放松 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe and release. There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.97,0:10:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These suckers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾看到它们窜出五十英尺高 就象火山一样…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen one jump…clear 50 feet out of the ground, like a volcano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一口就吞下一台大卡车 地面上只留下一个大黑洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swallowed a semi-truck whole. Now that's what I call roadkill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是真的… 这里是它们的主要猎食区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, yes, friends, this whole area is a major feeding ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了那个山脊有个牧羊人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just over that ridge there is where a simple shepherd…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.05,0:10:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的身体和羊群全被怪兽吃掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}named Old Fred lost his herd of sheep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.55,0:10:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后只剩下一个头颅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and everything eIse from the neck down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.31,0:10:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我所说的 我们已经到了 突袭蟒活动的中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now as I said, we're in the heart of graboid country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right in the heart of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好象有人来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Looks like we have company, folks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.37,0:10:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是突袭蟒吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man. Is that a graboid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好象是「警报」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, looks like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回去 否则脚就没了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back, son, you're going to lose a limb now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:10:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么那么多 镇静点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's flooded! Calm down, lady!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看到我们了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has it spotted us yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.34,0:11:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我还看不出来 只看出它大得离谱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I can't tell. But it's bigger than I've ever seen. Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.81,0:11:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.47,0:11:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它过来了 不要惊慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it comes! Take controI of yourself, don't panic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 它过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going. Come on. Moving in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.76,0:11:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶快离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'd better get the hell out of Dodge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.51,0:11:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这次能够发动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.49,0:11:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动了 这就是所谓的神迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it. It's called divine intervention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有杰克在你们会安然无恙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stick with Jack, you're going to make it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有一条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它好象闻到我们的味道 我以为它是听声音的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he picked up our scent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.95,0:11:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就是这个意思 - 听声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thought they only hunt by sound. - That's what I meant, sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.15,0:11:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,四{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 渴死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, baby. Been waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.51,0:11:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来一瓶吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.52,0:12:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先跳到这个岩石上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on now, hop on this here rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.52,0:12:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 把手给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go. Here you go. Give me your hand, darling. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 别让帽子飞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Hang on to your hat now. Here's the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.53,0:12:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都在吗？我来数数看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got everybody now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.53,0:12:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四 五 很好 全在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see here, one, two, three, four, five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们要等上一阵子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. Well, I think we just best wait it out a spell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看要等多久？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you think it will be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.11,0:12:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人 时间就象条无止境的河流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, ma'am, time is the eternaI river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能逆流而上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest we not swim upstream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.55,0:12:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里可真热{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, it's hot out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.37,0:12:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想来瓶冰凉的啤酒吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody up for an ice-cold beer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,本地啤酒三块一瓶 进口啤酒四块半一瓶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got $3 a bottle domestic, $4.50 imported.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还有新鲜果汁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, might I recommend my fresh fruit juices?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.56,0:12:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有芒果巨兽 葡萄突袭蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monster Mango. Graboid Grape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.57,0:12:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加一块钱 就可以保留瓶子当做纪念品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a buck extra, you can keep the souvenir glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.16,0:12:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上这里还会发光 你们看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glows in the dark. Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请输入密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please enter access code…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.92,0:13:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则一级安全程式 将在十秒内起动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or LeveI 1 security program will be activated in ten seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,九 八 七{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine seconds, eight seconds, seven seconds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,六 五…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}six seconds, five seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们的参加 我们今天真幸运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your business. I'd say we got pretty lucky out there today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一点也不错 - 我们看到的只是尘土而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Absolutely. - All we saw was dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 光看到尘土是运气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you want to see, believe me, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.63,0:13:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们顺着柏油路一直开 就能出山谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay on the blacktop now till you're clear out of the valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了介绍你的朋友来参加{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell your friends about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得补点冷饮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to restock the cooler here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早那袋冰你还没付钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, you didn't pay me for that bag of ice this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为那是送的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, I thought it was complimentary ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里可是在做生意呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in business here, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是呀 所以你应该以批发价卖给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I. I've been thinking you ought to sell me my refreshments at wholesale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 原因呢？- 那是自然界的共存法则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because? - It's a part of our symbiotic relationship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,共存法则 真有你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Symbiotic relationship. That's a good one, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实所有的东西都有关联{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Jodi, all things are related.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生意会带给你生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My business brings business to your business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.31,0:14:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我估计至少让你的生意 增加五十个百分点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably like an increase of about, approximately around…50%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.67,0:14:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是二十二个百分点 还要加上持续的不确定性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}22%, with questionable sustainability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,「持续的不确定性」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Questionable sustainability?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.43,0:14:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有企划案吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a business plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必计划得那么多 我深信宇宙的涨潮和退潮原理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try not to plan too much. I trust in the ebb and flow of the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,依如今经济发展的趋势看 必须要有计划才能成长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to plan to be a viable entity in today's economic landscape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.27,0:15:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,例如我在建立产品特性上 已进入第三阶段{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, me, I'm in phase three of establlshing my product identity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就象是比恩邮购公司的 独木舟啦 户外活动用品啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, L.L. Bean, "canoey, " outdoorsy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝安服饰公司的 高尔夫俱乐部啦 帆船啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Land's End, "goIf clubby, " "sailboaty."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.71,0:15:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我晓得了 象张氏杂货店的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see. I see. Chang's Market.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.71,0:15:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙漠啦 地下怪兽啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that, you know, that, kind of "deserty", "underground monstery"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.95,0:15:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All righty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你能顺利的成长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure hope nothing stops you from becoming a viable entity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我会很伤心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I hate when that happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把冰记在你的帐上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm billing you for that complimentary ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.37,0:16:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种粘土实在很棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I really like this clay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.76,0:16:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在窑里烧也不会裂 可惜太贵了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't crack in the kiIn, but it is so expensive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.31,0:16:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你订两百磅 就给你打个九折{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get 10% off if you order 200 pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还是太贵了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can't even afford that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.19,0:16:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 乔蒂 - 敏蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Jodi. - Hey, Mindy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.77,0:16:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把这交给杰克吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you give these to Jack when he comes in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 放在桌上就行 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. Throw them on the table. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.09,0:16:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂 你应该替他补起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy, I think Jack was expecting you to sew those pants…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是用胶布贴起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not just stick tape on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 贴起来已经足够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, tape is a totaI statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,象我们这类人就能完全了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People like Jack and I understand that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前偏爱用安全别针{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was into safety pins, myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 伯特 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Burt. - Hey, Mindy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.01,0:16:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂 我以为你上学去了 我妈没告诉你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were off at school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.37,0:16:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们付不起学费只好退学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom didn't tell you? I had to drop out. We couldn't afford the tuition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才回来 到琵市的奥比速食餐厅打工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm back working at the Arby's down in Bixby…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.29,0:16:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续在我妈的压力下过活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and trying to survive my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望将来会有所改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hope things work out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有冰啤酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beer is inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.97,0:17:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来时要小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Watch your step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gummer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.23,0:17:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀 能见到你是我的荣幸 我叫杰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! ReaI pleasure to meet you, sir. Jack Sawyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于对你们的崇拜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've started up this little tour business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我特别在这里经营旅游生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of an homage to you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你肯参与的话 铁定会使我增光不少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be honored if you would consider being a part of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.99,0:17:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要签签名 来点武器示范就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sign a few autographs…maybe a little weapons demonstration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 替我和怪兽拍一张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, take a picture of me with the tremor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.86,0:17:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们叫做「突袭蟒」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're called graboids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.39,0:17:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你们快来这边 看看这位是谁 快过来呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on over here, folks. Look who I've got for you. Come on down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.87,0:17:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是传奇人物伯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legendary Mr. Burt Gummer himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.69,0:18:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈 就是那个使枪的人 - 哇 真是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom, it's the gun guy. - It is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就站在这里 挺起胸膛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, MiIton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意吧？挺胸呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand right here, up straight. You don't mind, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,显出高高在上的英姿 再高点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight, honey. Nice and tall. Taller!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说「突袭蟒」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say "graboids."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.37,0:18:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「突袭蟒」 - 太棒了 谢谢你伯特先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Graboids. - Oh, great. Thank you so much, Mr. Goober.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么又有那种怪怪的表情 怎么搞的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had that look on your face. What was that about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.42,0:18:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 你又来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't start, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.66,0:18:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看他们已经深信不疑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're out of their gourd right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.90,0:18:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心灵之声告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My inner voice has been telling me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.15,0:18:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们注定会一起合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and I are destined to work together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我有心灵之声的话 一定会让我告诉你快滚蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had an inner voice it'd be telling me to tell you to get lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.74,0:18:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正不急在一时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, take your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.13,0:18:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就慢慢考虑 以后再告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just think about it and get back to me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会想通的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll come around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 巴佛 你少色了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buford! Get your head out of your pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.07,0:19:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在看风景而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just looking at the scenery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.02,0:19:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你口水都流出来了 去替下个团准备特效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drooling on yourself. Go set up for the next group.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不必这么凶嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be so mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.76,0:19:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我真想教训你一番{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you're about as sharp as a bowling ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你狠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tough guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.50,0:19:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 敏蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mindy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.71,0:19:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,头颅被撕裂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That skull was ripped wide open, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.96,0:19:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 眼珠掉出来 - 太恐怖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eyeballs popping out. - Ugly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 正如我所说的 你们已置身在 突袭蟒的中心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now as I said, you're in the heart of graboid country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.52,0:19:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们正在中心点上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right in the heart of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我郑重的警告各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you something, boys…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们正在他妈的中心点上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're right in the frigging heart of it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到了吗？- 我的天 你们看 越来越近了 那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey, did you see that? - Sweet Jesus! Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.99,0:19:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子怎么发动不起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a little engine trouble, folks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.99,0:20:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家不要惊慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm. Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到哪里去了？- 有杰克在你们会安然无恙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is it? - Stick with Jack, you'll make it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 别让帽子飞啦 救命呀 突袭蟒来啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on to your hats. Help, help, graboid attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.23,0:20:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们整天就干这些事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you guys do all day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.01,0:20:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有恶意 但看起来实在很无聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, no offense, Buford, but it's like tragically lame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.19,0:20:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,和以前比起来 这份差事要好得多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a good living. Compared to what I was doing before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.48,0:20:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责清理公路上的动物死尸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was…shoveling roadkill for the county.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.03,0:20:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I get you, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是为什么杰克愿意浪费时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why is Jack wasting his time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.59,0:20:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那些乡下人穷搅和呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}scamming yahoos with this Scooby-Doo routine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该能找到 一堆比这个要好的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet there are a zillion better things a guy like that could do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他一定是被女朋友甩了 或发生过什么不幸的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet he's nursing a broken heart. Or something totally tragic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.69,0:20:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定想找个 了解他的人倾诉一番{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet he's just dying to talk to somebody who understands him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.33,0:21:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 全都到齐了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we got everybody now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.13,0:21:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里真热 谁要来瓶冰凉的啤酒？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, it's hot out here. Anybody up for an ice-cold beer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道在这大太阳下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I couldn't help but notice that you're getting…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.76,0:21:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的皮肤被晒得很红{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}awfully red out here in the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要玩刀吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really have to keep doing that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.91,0:21:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这批探险团 到什么时候才结束？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When is this tour going to be over, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.09,0:21:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎不喜欢我陪你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't enjoy my company, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.66,0:21:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般男人会因此而生气的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man could take offense at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.85,0:21:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.88,0:22:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.35,0:22:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.16,0:23:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, give me your hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.59,0:23:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西根本不是真的 大家别说话 她是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing is not even real! Everybody, shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.62,0:23:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听她的 - 另一个人又是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- listen to her! - Who's that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.42,0:23:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the hell up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.30,0:23:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克的吉普车比它快 但我们先要让它转移目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack's jeep can outrun it, but we need a diversion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.26,0:23:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造噪音最有效 大家去找些东西来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some noise! Everybody, grab something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.51,0:23:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这给你 象什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.93,0:23:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便什么都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.78,0:23:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把东西朝那边扔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to throw stuff out that way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.68,0:23:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后跳进车里朝这边开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we're going to pile in the Jeep and hauI ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.23,0:23:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吗？好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it? Okay. On three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.72,0:23:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到三就扔 一 二 三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three! Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.24,0:24:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的照相机呢？你把我全新的照相机给扔了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my camera? You threw away my brand-new camera?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.26,0:24:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我们早就准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time we're ready for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.31,0:24:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你运来的突袭蟒 有四个触须而不是三个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This shipment of graboids has four tentacles instead of three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.61,0:24:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来怪怪的 没人会买的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look ridiculous. Nobody is going to buy them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.27,0:24:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？- 是伯特的警报器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell is that? - It's Burt's siren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.17,0:24:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,突袭蟒警报？不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The graboid ladder? It can't be real, Nancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.15,0:24:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是真的 否则不会响 快走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't blow the siren unless it was for real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.49,0:24:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望敏蒂没事 千万别做傻事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope Mindy's okay. Hope she doesn't do something stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.96,0:24:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不付钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not paying for them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.30,0:25:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为整个过程太小孩玩意了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask me, there's something very amateurish about this operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.53,0:25:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让游客 处于生死攸关的环境中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take people into a life-or-death situation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.70,0:25:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然连枪都是假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't have a reaI gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.60,0:25:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有营业执照吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you even licensed to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.31,0:25:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要看突袭蟒不是看到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to see a graboid, you saw a graboid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.31,0:25:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你们立刻朝西雅图出发 沿路千万别停车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I advise you to hit the highway and don't stop till you reach Seattle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.17,0:25:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要赔我那个照相机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect you to pay for that camera!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.27,0:25:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂 到底是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy, thank God! What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.49,0:25:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 它们回来了 我们才在那里遇到它 是活生生的突袭蟒吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, they're back. We just made it out. Graboids? Live ones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.48,0:25:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 我们找到一条 巴佛被它杀了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, we found one. Son of a bitch killed Buford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.02,0:25:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,才一下子的功夫… 巴佛就被它吞进肚子里去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, boom and he was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.63,0:25:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它像鲸鱼那么大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is like the size of a whale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.05,0:25:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我见过它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, I've seen them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.62,0:25:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 我们可以下来了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, is it okay? Can we come down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.31,0:25:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来吧 它们离得还远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on down. They're not close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.35,0:25:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查过我给你的地震仪吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You check the seismo-monitor I gave you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.62,0:26:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怎么好用 电池好象没了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working very well. I think the batteries are dead or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.36,0:26:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样嘛 都已经十一年啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Burt. It's been, what, 11 years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.69,0:26:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是伯特 请说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt here. Talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.48,0:26:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚的警报是真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, was that siren noise for real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.90,0:26:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Affirmative. No me chingas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.80,0:26:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在屋顶上吗？- 我当然在屋顶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You on your roof? - Damn right, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.38,0:26:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查过地震仪吗？附近有突袭蟒活动吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check your seismo-monitor? Any graboid activity near your ranch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.07,0:26:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那根针已经弯了 我一直想修它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, that aeriaI thing, it got bent, man. I've been meaning to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.51,0:26:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那大家最好待在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now it's all hands on deck, Miguel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.79,0:26:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你马上开车 以稳定的速度离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I suggest you bug out asap, maintain a steady speed on your truck…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.69,0:26:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,到总部张氏杂货店集合 你听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and report to HQ at Chang's, you copy that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.53,0:27:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好在只有三条 - 你怎么知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good news, there are only three. - How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.39,0:27:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前 我装置了地下监视器 监听整个山谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few years ago, I put a geophone monitoring system around the valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.35,0:27:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,资料传送到我的手提电脑 以便做三角测量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data transmits to my laptop, gets triangulated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.79,0:27:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是根据瑞妲的地质研究而得的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all based on Rhonda LeBeck's geologicaI research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.06,0:27:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我店里有卖她所有的书 - 漫画最好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I sell all her books. - The comics were better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.74,0:27:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.61,0:27:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们从北方逐渐接近 就象上次一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're moving slowly down from the north, just like last time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.43,0:27:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,从杰兹米平地直达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Jasmer quadrangle, straight down the valley…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.45,0:27:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡里波平地 - 他在讲什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- into Calypso quadrangle. - Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.45,0:27:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是指仙人掌平地 - 何必说得那么复杂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think he means Cactus Flats. - Why can't he just say it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.09,0:27:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.73,0:27:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以结束你的丛林探险团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your little jungle boat ride is over, mister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.08,0:27:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该是钓大鱼的时候了 - 那我们该怎么做呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time to fish or cut bait. - So what do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.56,0:27:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 伯特 这次我们不能再单独行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, excuse me, but we're not cut off this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.97,0:27:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,去扮演国民兵的角色了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to act like militia nitwits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.54,0:27:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以去求救{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll call for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.77,0:28:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于你们没有维护机器 更没有好好监视它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, since no one has bothered to maintain their seismic equipment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.48,0:28:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以它们什么时候开始活动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't know how long they've been active…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.79,0:28:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候会变成尖叫兽 我们一点概念也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and therefore have no idea when they may become shriekers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.85,0:28:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对等不及让当局来插手 一切要靠自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't wait for the authorities. We are the authorities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.94,0:28:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.01,0:28:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去追捕它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hunt them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.15,0:28:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀光它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wipe them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.50,0:28:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,黎明就出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can go at dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.83,0:28:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西真不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.23,0:28:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有多少存货 十一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many do you have in stock? Eleven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.56,0:28:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全部征收{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to requisition all of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.52,0:28:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我拿得到钱吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Requisition. Am I getting reimbursed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.32,0:28:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天不行 - 这东西真行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not today. - How does it work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.35,0:28:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是部玩具车罢了 我还是搞不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing them with a toy truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.57,0:28:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 突袭蟒靠感觉掠食 - 就是声音 这个我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Graboids hunt by sensing… - Sound. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.81,0:28:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当它听到玩具车的声音 就会像猫一样去追它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A graboid hears a toy truck, goes after it just like a cat to catnip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.23,0:29:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 漫画里曾提到过 - 等它把它吞下去 你就引爆炸药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's in the comic books. - When he swallows detonate the explosive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.46,0:29:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,轰 它就呜呼哀哉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom! End of worm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.91,0:29:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们没有炸药呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explosive. Where are we going to get the explosive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.57,0:29:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,官方虽没有正式批准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, not being an officially sanctioned event…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.81,0:29:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我仍旧提供本人的设计…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've provided something of my own design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.90,0:29:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特没问题 他知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about Burt. He knows what he's doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.46,0:29:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些记在我的账上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like his thing. Put these on my tab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.95,0:29:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把货装好马上出发 你根本没账嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mount up and move out. You don't have a tab!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.99,0:29:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 我和你一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, I'm going with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.38,0:29:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你不能和他一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.02,0:29:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.58,0:29:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 是伯特先生吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. Mr. Gummer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.36,0:29:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.55,0:29:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是法兰克探员 - 我表弟已经…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Agent Frank Statler. - My cousin, he went back to Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.95,0:30:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经申请过营业执照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've filed for my business license.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.09,0:30:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,人民的武装权是不容侵犯的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The right to bear arms shall not be infringed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.31,0:30:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是内政部的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Department of the Interior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.08,0:30:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是土地管理局的 外勤探员洛斯克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gentleman is Field Agent Rusk of the BLM…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.61,0:30:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,和美国国家博物馆的 古生物学家安德鲁博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Dr. Andrew Merllss, Director of Paleontology at Smithsonian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.60,0:30:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有事要办 没时间闲聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time to chat. We've got work to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.48,0:30:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能去追捕突袭蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if it's hunting graboids, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.57,0:30:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我叫他们来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called them, Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.15,0:30:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被下令严守 濒临绝种动物法中 第1472-B条款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was granted authority to insure adherence to Section 1472-B…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.62,0:30:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别保护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Endangered Species Act…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.70,0:30:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙漠中的大型爬虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which guards the welfare of large-class desert reptilians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.46,0:30:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下令在完美镇中 不准任何人猎杀突袭蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm enforcing an immediate ban on hunting of graboids in Perfection Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.15,0:30:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我养的牛就在那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are my cattle out there, pendejo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.25,0:30:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,土地管理局的人允许我射杀 任何危害牛群的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The BLM man gave permission to kill anything dangerous to my cattle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.50,0:30:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是野狼 郊狼 或是突袭蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}EI lobo, eI coyote and eI graboid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.64,0:30:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有土地管理局的人都归他管 如今他也得听我的指挥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your BLM man reports to him, who reports to me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.70,0:30:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你们不准杀戮突袭蟒 就这么简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm here to tell you there will be no more killing of graboids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.33,0:30:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,若让它们活下去 我们就会成了濒临绝种的动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we let them live, and we become the endangered species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.14,0:30:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经两次在两大洲 帮助当地政府{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been instrumentaI in the eradication of the oldest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.65,0:31:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭这种地球上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}rarest species on earth. Not once, .{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.34,0:31:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,最古老 罕见的生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but on three separate occasions, on two continents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.93,0:31:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是替那两国政府 保卫他们的人民和财产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defending lives and property, a guest of two foreign governments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.48,0:31:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可知道民众在抗议吗？- 什么民众 是这里的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you even aware of the public outcry? - Public? Not this public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.66,0:31:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的指令很简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mandate is simple:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.22,0:31:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查 活捉并运回去做研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To investigate, trap and transport at least one creature for study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.55,0:31:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,「活捉并运回去」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trap and transport?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.20,0:31:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你们发现做不到的时候 它们已变形成尖叫兽了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you find out that's impossible, we'll be overcome with shriekers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.40,0:31:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们发现对民众有威胁时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we discover there is a threat to public safety…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.35,0:31:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会立刻疏散完美镇 无限期的封闭此地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're prepared to evacuate Perfection Valley and seal it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.45,0:31:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你要我们离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute! You'd make us leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.58,0:31:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是叫你们来帮忙 不是让你们来赶我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not why I called you. I called you here to help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.87,0:31:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,州长会给你们合理的补偿金 这点你们不用担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The government will offer compensation for your property. That's a given.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.42,0:31:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是所谓的国家征用权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eminent domain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.03,0:31:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们居然说我是偏执狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And people call me paranoid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.70,0:31:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you're paranoid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.05,0:31:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来是这么想 现在不会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, but not no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.64,0:32:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个杂种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.30,0:33:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,「叫我以实玛利」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Call me Ishmael."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.60,0:33:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你这快绝种的身体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if you would kindly lean your endangered carcass…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.45,0:33:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一超过我土地的界限{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}over my property line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.11,0:33:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能以自卫原因杀死你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call your untimely demise self-defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.30,0:33:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,又笨又浑的突袭蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn stupid graboids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.74,0:33:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的店绝不能被征收{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't afford to get eminent domain out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.49,0:33:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所有的钱全投资在生意上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every cent I have is tied to this business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.85,0:33:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你至少还有个生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least you got a business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.21,0:33:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的肢体语言已经表达了一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Body language says it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.39,0:34:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要来点冰啤酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it say I could use a cold beer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.04,0:34:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要哪个牌子？- 米勒淡啤酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What will it be? - Miller Lite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.96,0:34:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里手机打不出去 你们可以用公共电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we still don't have cell towers. You can use the pay phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.81,0:34:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在外面 有民用波段和对讲机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside it's CBs and walkie-talkies only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.85,0:34:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.85,0:34:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说要赶我们走 不是当真吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys weren't serious about making us move out, were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.86,0:34:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非能活捉它们 否则别无他法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless we can catch one of them, we may have no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.93,0:34:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这是个小行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It kind of seems like a small operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.16,0:34:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过去抓条突袭蟒罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, to catch one whole graboid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.01,0:34:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的经费不多 对华盛顿来说这不是最高优先{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much of a budget. It's not a high priority in Washington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.92,0:34:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是若真捉到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you did catch one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.67,0:35:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们岂不是光荣返乡吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you boys would go home heroes, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.44,0:35:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在履历表上还可加上一笔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look good on a resume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.02,0:35:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么建议？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your point would be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.65,0:35:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实唯一熟悉那东西的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one guy who knows about these things…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.24,0:35:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能真正帮你们的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one guy who could help out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.14,0:35:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,已被你三阵出局 正在坐冷板凳呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is warming up the bench because you took him out of the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.66,0:35:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没要他出局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't take him out of the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.21,0:35:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 别忘了他们不是你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I remind you, Jack, they are not your friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.18,0:35:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是政府官员 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are government agents. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.27,0:35:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是和他们谈判了一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut me some slack. All I did was negotiate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.93,0:35:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你做了什么？- 我和他们达成协议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You did what? - I cut us a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.23,0:35:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们替他们抓条突袭蟒 他们就让你继续狩猎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We help catch one live graboid, they give you back your hunting license.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.92,0:35:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 了解 还有一个问题 - 说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Copy that. Roger. One question. - Shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.74,0:35:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脑袋短路了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your head up your ass for the warmth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.65,0:35:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以为你会喜欢这个主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought you'd be happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.28,0:36:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是不想被征收吗？- 抓活的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to get eminent domained out? - Catch a live graboid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.64,0:36:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些活生生的突袭蟒 用炸药已经很难杀它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard enough to kill one without saturation bombing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.95,0:36:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他们 没什么事能难倒伯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told them, Burt Gummer, he'd come up with something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.65,0:36:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙很聪明 越逼它们就越厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bastards are smart, and they'll get smarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.09,0:36:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你仍胜过它们呀 我认为你应该接受挑战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still here, aren't you? I'd say you're up to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.10,0:36:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特先生 你说呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mr. Gummer, what do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.97,0:36:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个好机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fish or cut bait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.48,0:36:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.73,0:36:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有麻醉它们的东西吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}say you have some sort of tranquilizer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.98,0:36:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用麻醉镖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're using tranq darts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.44,0:36:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会追这些怪物 可惜却无法穿过地面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got them to chase us, but couldn't get these to penetrate dirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.92,0:37:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经去订用钛做的弹头 和更有力的发射枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ordering titanium tips and a more powerfuI launch gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.61,0:37:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦 尽量去浪费纳税人的钱嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, you could squander the taxpayers' money…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.14,0:37:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这东西只要四十九块九毛五{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can get a graboid to swallow this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.38,0:37:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要把麻醉药放在车里 让它吞下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with this, for $49.95.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.71,0:37:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就会失去知觉 而你们就能趁机把它挖出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, if it goes to sleep, you can dig it up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.73,0:37:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,运到51区或别的地方去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}take it back to Area 51…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.35,0:37:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给你们那个无知的上司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or whatever fits your plausible deniability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.40,0:37:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是很了解你的话 我们到底达成协议没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand what you just said, but do we have a deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.47,0:37:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们想知道应该怎么去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we want to know what we should do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.31,0:37:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,去做你们最擅长的事呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys do what you do best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.05,0:37:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是把简单的事情复杂化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find something simple and complicate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.17,0:37:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他表达了自己的想法 压抑情绪实在很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good he expresses himself. Repressed emotions can be reaI toxic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.02,0:37:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要心理医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs counseling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.52,0:37:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上车 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get in! - Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.13,0:37:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你既然把我扯进来 就别想置身事外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me into this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.83,0:37:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.64,0:38:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有门不会用吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.50,0:38:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unbelievable!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.09,0:38:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太不可思议了 实在难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, Charlie. It's unbelievable. Unbelievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.15,0:38:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在所谓突袭蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was doing cores…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.75,0:38:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,最早期的活动地点上 挖掘岩芯样品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}out where they recorded the earliest graboid movements. Voila!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.78,0:38:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第三个地点挖到这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hit this on my third dig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.03,0:38:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是蛋 证明它们由蛋孵化而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an egg. I've proven they come from eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.27,0:38:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用碳十四年代测定法 测定过了 里面的蛋黄是新鲜的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already carbon-dated it. The yolk remains are current…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.94,0:38:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是蛋壳却有三百岁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the shell is over 300 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.50,0:38:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的突袭蟒一定由此而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graboids must have come from these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.18,0:38:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道它们沉睡了三百年吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They lay dormant for 300 years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.12,0:38:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smoething like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.12,0:38:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话借我用一下 我得打电话给博物馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears so. I need to use your phone. I must call the museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.13,0:38:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出五十元向你买{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you $50 for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.60,0:38:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧 那是属于美国国家博物馆的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going straight to the Smithsonian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.30,0:38:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就一百元吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right. $100.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.84,0:39:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人要结婚了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody getting married?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.27,0:39:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先我们制造噪音 好引诱它靠近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, we make enough noise to lure one in close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.55,0:39:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后用摇控车做饵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, we use the remote-controlled truck as bait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.35,0:39:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些讨厌的政府官员 明明叫他们别插手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn feds. I told them to butt out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.87,0:39:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好象是别人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think that's somebody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.97,0:39:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 好久不见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Burt. Long time no see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.57,0:39:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看来很不错 你还是老样子 马文？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking good. Hard core as ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.84,0:39:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马文？- 叫我小马就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Melvin? - It's Mel, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.78,0:39:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么从不回信 害我跑这么远来找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you never answer our letters, and I got to drive all the way out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.68,0:40:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「完美谷牧场」 是你在卖？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfection Valley Ranchettes. That's you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.00,0:40:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还说我永远成不了大业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I'd never amount to anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.32,0:40:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将要举办大特卖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Burt, we're making some really good deals here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.36,0:40:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是我的朋友 所以先告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between you and me, because we're friends…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.49,0:40:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将以 比别人高一倍的价钱向你收购{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll get twice what we're offering the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.87,0:40:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在这里长大的 怎么这样乱搞一通呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing? You grew up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.25,0:40:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才给你这么好的条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. I wouldn't wish this place on anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.24,0:40:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, come on, Burt. What do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.46,0:40:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好立即消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say, I'll give you a ten-second head start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.19,0:40:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都准备搬家了 整个郡马上就在我掌握之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are folding, Burt, and I got this whole county in my pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.71,0:40:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没办法坚持下去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't hold out forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.15,0:40:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生来就这么顽固{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born to hold out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.24,0:40:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 是不是不对劲了？看来不太对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, is this bad? It looks kind of bad here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.66,0:40:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this bad? It's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.63,0:40:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是突袭蟒 不要动 保持安静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graboid. One of them spotted us. Freeze. Everybody, quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.28,0:40:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 突袭蟒？- 别出声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A graboid? - Quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.33,0:40:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.43,0:40:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当真？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.29,0:41:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt! Burt, hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.30,0:41:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 你要撑下去 我去拿绳子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Burt, hang on. I'll get a rope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.83,0:42:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,休士顿 我们有麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houston, we have a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.23,0:42:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是伯特吗？- 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Burt? - Affirmative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.21,0:42:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.10,0:42:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有太多时间 空气不够 我的位置在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much time. Only got limited air. What's my 20?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.34,0:42:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.44,0:42:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在西方四分之一英里处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're about a quarter mile west…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.68,0:42:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞错了 你在东方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, better make that east of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.71,0:42:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我家只有几英里 就在那儿和它交战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of miles from my place, engage the graboid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.16,0:42:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.47,0:42:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开车把它引到我家的前门去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive like hell, and lead the bastard through my front gate. Copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.47,0:42:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗？听到了 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I copy, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.55,0:42:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,空气没有了 通话完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of air. Burt out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.55,0:42:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我到达后该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt! Burt, what do I do when I get there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.15,0:42:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I do? Burt! Burt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.36,0:43:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀 突袭蟒 不怕就来呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, graboid. Come on, baby, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.21,0:43:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.26,0:43:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙上钩啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are running with the graboid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.20,0:43:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.70,0:43:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞个正着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head-on colllsion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.79,0:43:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 你在下面吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt! Burt, are you down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.07,0:43:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我马上回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. I'll be right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.52,0:44:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要撑下去 千万别放弃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, buddy! Hang on, buddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.17,0:44:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续呼吸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just breathe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.86,0:44:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.72,0:44:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, buddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.24,0:44:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.96,0:44:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.17,0:44:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 马文那家伙说你们被攻击了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack! That Melvin guy said you got attacked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.48,0:44:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么呀？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.20,0:45:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd prefer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.16,0:45:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们别把这件事…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we keep this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.96,0:45:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.95,0:45:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一没人管你们马上就出事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys definitely need to be supervised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.02,0:45:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是伯特 你能听到吗？请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt here. You read me? Come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.38,0:45:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回答 这是伯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back. Burt here. Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.12,0:45:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是突袭蟒吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a graboid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.23,0:45:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但我们应该看到两条才对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we should be seeing two of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.63,0:46:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府官员们有消息吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have either of you heard from the feds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.24,0:46:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法联系到他们 从今早起就音讯全无{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't raise them. Not since this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.78,0:46:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概超出无线电的范围 他们本来在追突袭蟒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess they've gone out of radio range. They were chasing a graboid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.71,0:46:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们追它而不是它追他们 看来似乎不妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were chasing it? It wasn't chasing them? I don't like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.33,0:46:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们把它吓走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, maybe they scared it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.00,0:46:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀 那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, what is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.13,0:46:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德鲁博士 发生什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Merllss, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.50,0:46:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在地上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found the graboid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.24,0:46:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到一条突袭蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.84,0:46:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是它是… - 中空的 分成两半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was… - Hollow. Split open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.26,0:46:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 分成两半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, split open. Split open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.78,0:46:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,空的 当我们检查它的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we examined it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.55,0:47:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.03,0:47:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种声音 是尖叫的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard this screaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.85,0:47:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后它们把我们围起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they were all around us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.01,0:47:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作非常快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So fast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.32,0:47:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛斯克和法兰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rusk and Statler…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.18,0:47:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,被撕成碎片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}torn to pieces!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.64,0:47:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们居然把我的小货车拆开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hid in my van, but they were ripping it apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.39,0:47:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我突然想起… 它们会感应到热能 所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remembered something. Don't let them see body heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.45,0:47:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把全身喷满灭火剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sprayed myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.38,0:47:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好冷 快冻死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cold. It's so cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.36,0:47:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 你处理的很好 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was good. That was good thinking. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.62,0:47:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不完全有效 我恐怕…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not entirely effective, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.00,0:48:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 南茜 敏蒂 请回话 - 我们在张氏杂货店的屋顶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nancy, Mindy. Come back. - Yes, Burt. We're on Chang's roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.91,0:48:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 突袭蟒还在到处乱跑吗？- 现在问题更大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is the graboid still around? - We've got a bigger problem now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.64,0:48:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是尖锐兽吗？- 不对 是尖声兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Squealers? - No, screechers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.87,0:48:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是尖叫兽 政府官员全被它们杀光了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shriekers. The government team is all dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.55,0:48:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 你们听好 这些家伙听不到声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God. These SOBs don't hunt by sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.34,0:48:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,全靠头上的感热器官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see heat with sensor organs on their heads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.12,0:48:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须要隐藏你们的体温 懂了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to hide your body heat somehow. Copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.25,0:48:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐藏我们的体温？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide our body heat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.30,0:48:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, we copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.60,0:48:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在无法用 地下监听器去追踪尖叫兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't track shriekers with geophones…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.71,0:48:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只好非法下载红外线卫星影像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm rigged to download infrared satellite images.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.57,0:48:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当它第一次变形 一共只有六支尖叫兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When shriekers first emerge, there are only six of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.68,0:48:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要在它们找到食物 开始复制前杀了它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can kill them before they find food and multiply, we have a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.29,0:48:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看 那是普雷斯顿干河 开吉普车的路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here we go. Preston Dry Lake. Jeep trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.85,0:48:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们 那是我们的车 对不对？好 找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we are. Those are our cars, right? Reading the engine heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.73,0:49:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以看到它们了 二 四… 一共有七支{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo. We have a visual. Two, four. There are seven of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.22,0:49:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这表示它们已开始复制了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, they're already making more of themselves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.71,0:49:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它们吃了法兰克和洛斯克 我们得快点行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they munched on Statler and Rusk. We better get moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.72,0:49:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的命怎么这么苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I totally hate my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.22,0:49:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要命 还是没看到它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, I still don't see them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.90,0:49:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么对焦距 用我的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you focus these things? Here, try these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.77,0:49:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 最好再查一下卫星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better get that satellite thing again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.75,0:49:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在查 就在那里 天…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got you covered. That's it, right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.78,0:49:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成八支了 它们都吃些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's eight of them. What are they eating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.50,0:49:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,郊狼 蜥蜴 蛇 什么都吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coyotes, lizards, snakes. They don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.68,0:49:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这的确很严重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is really serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.09,0:50:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我一直在警告你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep trying to tell you people! How far are your cattle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.93,0:50:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的牛群离这有多远？若让它们找到 我们就完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they get to your herd, we're in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.64,0:50:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.67,0:50:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们要到那个峡谷里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look there. They're going into that box canyon over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.01,0:50:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 那里只有一条路可以出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.35,0:50:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以赶在它们之前到达 - 我跟你一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If we get there before… - I'm with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.29,0:50:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 然后把它们全杀光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just roll in and mop those little devils up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.81,0:50:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是突袭蟒 快往岩石方向跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graboids!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.81,0:50:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.82,0:50:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 哇 我的…哪里来的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miguel! Where the hell…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.84,0:50:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.51,0:50:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过活的突袭蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen a live one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.20,0:50:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.41,0:51:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.92,0:51:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知南茜和敏蒂去求救{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radio Nancy and Mindy to call for some kind of help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.12,0:51:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它居然想吃我的吉普车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn thing tried to eat my Jeep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.22,0:51:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的脑袋在想什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is it thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.65,0:51:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的引擎还在转动 而它只追逐声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The engine. He went for the noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.05,0:51:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看过突袭蟒的漫画吗？上面写得很清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't you read the graboid comics? It's all in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.48,0:51:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌的爬虫 汽车的钱还没付清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaking slug. I owe money on that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.39,0:51:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 你有对讲机吗？- 在吉普车里 你的呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack, you got your walkie? - It's in my Jeep. Where's yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.17,0:51:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在车盖上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my hood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.94,0:51:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来… 只好等了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we just wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.53,0:51:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真倒霉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darn! Man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.04,0:52:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不担心尖叫兽会逃出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you worried that the shriekers might get out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.75,0:52:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑去吃掉米格的牛群 和整个内华达州吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go eat Miguel's cattle, and, I don't know, the rest of Nevada?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.77,0:52:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然担心 但由于我无法控制 只好随他去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely. But I do not dwell on that over which I have no control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.90,0:52:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以变成由我来发愁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great. I have to do all the dwelling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.58,0:52:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you choose to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.11,0:52:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜我发现了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I've found?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.93,0:52:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多人喜欢积雨云的多变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people prefer your dramatic cumulus and nimbus clouds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.23,0:52:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我却特别欣赏卷云 它真美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've always had a weakness for a cirrus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.24,0:52:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么微弱的挂在天上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Wispy, and way up there, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.67,0:52:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我倒不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.10,0:52:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 难道你不向上看吗？- 我很忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, don't you ever look up? - I'm busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.55,0:52:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙得没时间看天空？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too busy to look up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.36,0:52:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确如此 我为生活而打拼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, as a matter of fact, I am. I'm working for myself here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.38,0:52:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初真该留在旧金山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? I could have stayed in San Francisco…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.27,0:53:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,去读个企业管理硕士 年薪赚个十几万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}parlayed my MBA into a six-figure income. But, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.58,0:53:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果却跑来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm busting my ass eking a living out here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.59,0:53:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为了梦想而卖命 - 我知道谋生不容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to build something for myself. - I know it's not easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.45,0:53:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但偶尔享受一下也不为过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I just think you can enjoy yourself while you eke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.66,0:53:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说我没有享受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says I'm not enjoying myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.15,0:53:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我不需要向你解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't have to justify myself to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.44,0:53:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,「食物大卖场」？你这个小人 居然说只向我买货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foodmall? You said you bought all your supplies from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.85,0:53:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没有签什么约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't recall signing any purchasing agreement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.69,0:53:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是口头承诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a verbai commitment. It was understood, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.59,0:53:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你常占据我的电话线 和电脑所做的交换条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange for tying up my telephone lines and my computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.62,0:53:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等于省了一笔支出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting free overhead, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.61,0:53:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你错了 我过得很快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, for your information, I do enjoy myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.22,0:53:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.17,0:54:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好在尖叫兽仍在峡谷里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one bit of good news. The shriekers are still in the canyon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.69,0:54:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次在我家外面的就是这条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to be the same one I saw outside my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.53,0:54:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它好象得了白化病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Albino, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.02,0:54:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我有支母羊也得了这种病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to have a female goat like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.72,0:54:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此无法生小羊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.05,0:54:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,患了不育症{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lmpossible. Sterile?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.61,0:54:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以它才没变成尖叫兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's why EI Blanco hasn't turned into Los Shriekers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.72,0:54:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个杂…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.01,0:54:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,清晨五点正{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}5:00, on the dot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.23,0:54:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳马上就出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be sunrise soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.72,0:54:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有三十七分三十二秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 37 minutes, 32 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.10,0:55:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 小心 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Burt. Heads up! What? Why, you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.80,0:55:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它老跟着你 似乎喜欢上你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He follows you, Burt. I think he's got a thing for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.82,0:55:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,若有那支五十口径的枪 就让它好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could reach my Grizzly.50-caliber, I'd have a thing for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.37,0:55:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是它们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.78,0:55:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.33,0:55:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我从没听过它们这么吵闹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've never heard them make a noise like that before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.38,0:55:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定又大开杀戒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like coyotes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.99,0:55:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们仍在谷里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with their kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.15,0:56:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再等了 我得把对讲机弄过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still in the canyon. Can't afford to wait. I've got to get to my radio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.73,0:56:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 用这个试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Burt! Try this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.42,0:56:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在马盖先影集里看过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it on a repeat of MacGyver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.87,0:56:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是牙线 我永远随身携带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dentai floss! I always carry it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.18,0:56:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. There, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.25,0:56:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Come on. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.19,0:56:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了 勾到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, you got it. Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.34,0:56:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜 敏蒂 这是伯特 请回话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy! Mindy! Burt here. Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.02,0:56:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.51,0:56:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被一条白色突袭蟒盯住了 需要你们的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're pinned down by…this great white graboid, and we need an assist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.96,0:57:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你在对讲机里 制造出很大的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to make one hell of a racket over the radio. Copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.37,0:57:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要噪音 我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want noise, Burt? I copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.63,0:57:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 怎么回事？- 伯特打电话来点歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey, what's going on? - Burt just phoned in a request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.05,0:57:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,它中计了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.65,0:57:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶快行动 还要一支{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. One more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.47,0:57:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它又回来了 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's coming back! - Yep{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.67,0:58:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它去追饵去了 乔蒂 杰克 我们快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taken the bait. Jodi, Jack, let's move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.97,0:58:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这给你 这是大型四发连发枪 它不会咬你的 - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is yours:.308, four shots in the mag. - I don't know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.26,0:58:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 拿着你的韦瑟斯比 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't bite you. Jack, grab your Weatherby and let's do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.74,0:58:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的韦瑟…什么？- 你的来复枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My "Weather" what? - Your rifle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.68,0:58:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在你的枪架上 - 那是假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In your gun rack? - The gun is not real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.37,0:58:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向搞电影的人买的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Borrowed it off some movie guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.61,0:58:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这给你 你总知道子弹从那里射出吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. You do know which end the bullets come out of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.20,0:58:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在电影里看过 - 你看来有点冷 把衣服穿上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've seen movies. - Here. You look cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.97,0:58:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就去征服尖叫兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's go bag our limit of shriekers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.14,0:58:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.70,0:58:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们应该在转弯的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has to be right around that bend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.73,0:58:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么… - 它们在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the… - Jeez, what are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.73,0:58:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.37,0:59:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不过这可以让它们软化点 - 我还记得这个宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's tenderize them a little. - I remember these babies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.11,0:59:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.75,0:59:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 我的天 他还真干上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit! He doesn't fool around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.52,0:59:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特是很认真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt is very committed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.69,0:59:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 我们进攻吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on! Let's hit them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.54,0:59:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.07,0:59:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们蒸发了 根本看不到它们的踪迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vaporized them! I mean, there's nothing left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.38,0:59:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 至少会看到尸体 不可能完全不见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. We should see remains. They wouldn't just disintegrate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.44,0:59:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道？- 我以前曾经杀过它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know? - I've blown them up before!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.32,0:59:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那看起来象是 某种脱掉的壳或是皮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like they shed some kind of husk or skin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.18,0:59:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就象蛇一样 - 看来似乎不妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- like a snake. - I don't like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.21,1:00:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们可能又钻回地底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they went back underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.08,1:00:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,先去找我的卡车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just go find my truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.89,1:00:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我蛮喜欢那部卡车的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt! I really liked that truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.74,1:00:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定很伤心 那是全新的车 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man. That has to hurt. It was new, wasn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.24,1:00:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少它死得轰轰烈烈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least it died for a good reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.86,1:00:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有各式各样的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my Grizzly Big Bore. My sidearms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.12,1:00:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,和火药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ammo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.09,1:00:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西在动 在围墙后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something moved, over behind the fence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.86,1:01:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是尖叫兽吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shrieker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.11,1:01:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经不是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not no more, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.82,1:01:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在墨西哥和阿根廷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Mexico and Argentina, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.19,1:01:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在它们刚变形的十二小时内 就全被我们消灭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we killed them before they lived 12 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.87,1:01:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是它们第二次变形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what happens when you don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.58,1:01:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以它们象 病毒一样不断突变吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just keep mutating like a virus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.88,1:01:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.81,1:01:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看那家伙同样能感应热能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look. That son of a gun has the same heat sensor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.88,1:01:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在追踪我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracking us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.11,1:01:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,设陷阱去捉它太危险了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not smart to track Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.90,1:01:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,它现在在干吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it doing now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.07,1:01:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.92,1:02:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开枪 快 瞄准就开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point, shoot! Come on! Point, shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.93,1:02:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.53,1:02:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 天呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.95,1:02:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错 我应该早开枪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have taken that shot. Should have shot sooner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.24,1:02:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不知道 它会象火箭一样起飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you know it was going to take off like a goddamn rocket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.81,1:03:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 把你的对讲机给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, give me your walkie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.98,1:03:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是伯特 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, Mindy? Burt here. Come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.60,1:03:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 我们都在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Burt. We're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.50,1:03:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜 你听着 它们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, llsten. They…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.28,1:03:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们杀了米格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed Miguel. He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.88,1:03:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀 那不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.32,1:03:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 米格死了？不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, Miguel? No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.42,1:03:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜 这是乔蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy? Jodl here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.72,1:03:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,尖叫兽现在能飞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shriekers can fly now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.16,1:03:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快离开屋顶 那里不安全 听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, get off the roof. You're not safe up there anymore. Copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.72,1:03:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁起来 锁上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock it! Lock it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.55,1:04:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.77,1:04:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？它们不是只能感觉到热量吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? They can only see heat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.78,1:04:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不笨 走 到冷藏柜里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not dumb, you know! Come on, into the meat locker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.43,1:05:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 我从来没觉得你笨过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, I never thought you were dumb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.81,1:05:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋 突袭蟒的蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An egg. Graboid egg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.20,1:05:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以从突袭蟒到尖叫兽 再演化成这种新的怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's a graboid, to a shrieker, to one of these here new things…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.82,1:05:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又回到突袭蟒 在生物学上完全可以成立{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and finally back to a graboid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.37,1:05:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想它们之所以能够飞翔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would make sense, biologically. I guess they developed the ability to fly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.10,1:05:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了把蛋带到远方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they can carry the eggs as far as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.43,1:05:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 你们看 它居然会和空气产生化学作用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at that. Look at that right there. Reacts with the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.97,1:05:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻起来象腐烂的豆子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smells like a bad night of beans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.84,1:05:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是高浓度的辛烷胃酸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some high-octane stomach acid he has there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.84,1:05:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,极易反应 几乎象纯钠一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extremely reactive. Almost like pure sodium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.13,1:05:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么 它们拼命突变 他妈的屁…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, they work it up there in their ass, see…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.85,1:06:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 所以它们才能飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - No, no. That's how they blast off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.77,1:06:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次变形总会出现新的能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always something new with these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.01,1:06:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 你们的枪全空了 这么快？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, forget it, you're both empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.42,1:06:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 空了？- 你开了十发 她开了四发 我的也空了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Empty? - Already? You fired ten, she fired four. I'm empty, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.33,1:06:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下可好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.11,1:06:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家离这里三英里远 最好能过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. My place is three miles away. We have to try to make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.12,1:06:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这些家伙在天上监视 怎么走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With these honkers doing aerial recon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.60,1:06:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要想办法隐藏我们的体温{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to conceal our body heat somehow. All right, it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.88,1:06:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个笨方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make a dumb suggestion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.89,1:06:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 既然是我们发现的 就应该由我们替它命名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! All I'm saying is, we discovered them, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.46,1:06:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想想看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we should name them. Let me think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.24,1:06:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞翔尝试 怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay."Blast-Offers."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.67,1:06:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是屁股发射 这个比较好 屁股开花 怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or "Butt-Launchers." That's better? "Ass-Blasters!" How's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.20,1:06:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点象成人电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a porno film.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.91,1:07:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}llsten!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.59,1:07:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down! Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.13,1:07:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它没看到我们 我们没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't see us! We're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.93,1:07:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有约会吗？- 讨厌的阿白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lunch date? - Damn! EI Blanco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.66,1:07:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？那条白色的突袭蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry? White graboid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.78,1:07:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,正朝着我们过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's moving towards us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.85,1:07:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,连休息一下也不行 走这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we get a break here? Come on, come on. This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.95,1:07:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个山脊下全是花岗岩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beneath this ridge is a solid granite intrusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.34,1:07:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来阿白只好改路走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll follow it, but EI Blanco will have to go around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.95,1:07:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,花岗岩？几乎整个峡谷的地质 我都记住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granite intrusion? I memorized the valley's geology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.96,1:07:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我也想这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. I been meaning to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.96,1:07:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器给我 你们随意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your weapons and make yourselves at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.14,1:07:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查一下南茜和敏蒂 是不是也安全无恙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see if Nancy and Mindy got through to the Air NationaI Guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.00,1:08:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 这么多选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots of choices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.39,1:08:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜 敏蒂 这是伯特 请回话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, Mindy. Burt here. Come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.37,1:08:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特呼叫南茜和敏蒂 请回话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt calling Nancy and Mindy. Copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.24,1:08:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我买的那些货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know those supplies I bought?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.01,1:08:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以成本价卖给你好吗？- 有罪恶感了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How about I let you have them at cost? - Feeling guilty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.01,1:08:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,南茜 敏蒂 请回话 有一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy, Mindy. Come back. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.49,1:08:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最主要的是我想筹旅费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mostly I'm going to need traveling money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.02,1:08:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特呼叫南茜和敏蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt calling Nancy and Mindy. Copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.00,1:08:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.53,1:09:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是伯特 请回话 南茜？敏蒂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt here. Come back. Nancy? Mindy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.36,1:09:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 南茜 敏蒂 回答我 - 这样说你想离开这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nancy? Mindy? Talk to me. - So, you'll be leaving?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.19,1:09:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,总不能在 客人会被吃掉的地方做生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't run a business where your customers get eaten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.67,1:09:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说的没错 - 南茜 敏蒂 这是伯特 请回话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guess not. - Nancy, Mindy, Burt here. Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.64,1:09:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 希望他们没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! Hope they got out okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.43,1:09:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们的老友阿白终于来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our old friend EI Blanco is finally coming this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.34,1:09:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心 这周围能完全抵挡突袭蟒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to worry, our perimeter is completely graboid-proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.07,1:09:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是能抵挡屁股开花兽吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is it Ass-Blaster-proof?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.08,1:09:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 我来拿武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. I'll grab my weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.08,1:09:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.08,1:09:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到安全室去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, into the safe room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.31,1:09:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.61,1:10:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,封闭它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.10,1:10:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些是什么 食物吗？- 是MRE 比普通食物还棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is all this? Food? - Better. MREs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.22,1:10:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,「即食便餐」 是营养成份最高的食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most dense, most nutritious food known to man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.21,1:10:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能在这里待多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, how long can we wait it out in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.11,1:10:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,六 七年吧 这得看怎么分配食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six, seven years. Depending on how well you maintain your dietary discipline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.77,1:10:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们居然想把门溶化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch is meIting the door down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.86,1:10:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些丁烷屁股开花的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn his butane, butt-blasting ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.38,1:10:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管了 来这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget that! Here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.37,1:10:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 逃生隧道 - 伯特 我喜欢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Escape tunnel! - Burt, I like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.57,1:10:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should! Go on, go on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.88,1:10:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这些家伙 吃了你的食物会怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens if this thing eats your food?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.82,1:11:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就会变成军队了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ass-blaster blitzkrieg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.52,1:11:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 我来善后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on! I'll take care of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.20,1:11:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们看谁厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trick or treat, you son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.74,1:11:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是五加仑的无铅汽油 - 天呀 你想得真周全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Five gallons of unleaded. - Man. You really go the distance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.64,1:11:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我是自毁宗师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm a masterpiece of self-destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.65,1:11:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我计算 火苗到达重装火药点应该…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire should reach my stock of reloading powder right about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.38,1:11:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在 找掩护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.22,1:12:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这边 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Over here. Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.23,1:12:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伯特？- 又怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Burt! - Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.24,1:12:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 你到哪里去了 我们一直联络不到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, where've you been? We've been trying to raise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.24,1:12:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你绝对不会相信 - 你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You won't believe it. - No, try me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.62,1:12:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到一支会飞的尖叫兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know those flying shriekers? We've got one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.24,1:12:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实它几乎杀了我们 你猜我们怎么抓到它的？用食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, it almost got us, but you know how we got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.12,1:12:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它吃了我一半的存货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food! It ate half the food in the store!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.15,1:12:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在已进入昏睡状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they eat enough, they go into a food coma!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.25,1:12:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 它们会繁殖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. They multiply!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.90,1:12:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不会 只要继续喂它吃 把你的MRE喂它们就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Burt, they don't! Just feed it! Give it all your MREs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.26,1:12:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 你听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, do you copy? Burt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.27,1:13:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, do you copy? Burt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.78,1:13:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特暂时不在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt's… Burt is not available at the moment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.32,1:13:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但谢谢你的新资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but thanks for the update, Nancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.72,1:13:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么样的神和我玩这种把戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of Supreme Being would condone such irony?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.72,1:13:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有句名言是：「神枪手只瞄准自己」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there are those who say, the marksman aims at himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.07,1:13:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在需要进入空的境界中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power of non-attachment. You need to tap into that right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.28,1:13:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 拜托少打禅语啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough with the Zen zingers, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.31,1:13:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 你要坚持下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt? Maintain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.31,1:13:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备了一辈子 结果成了难民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lifetime of preparation, and I end up a refugee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.01,1:13:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在不想说 但我认为在经历过这些爆炸后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to ask, but have we gone through all this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.22,1:13:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最后可能还是被阿白吃掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to be eaten by EI Blanco?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.32,1:13:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸的声音会把它吓跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The explosions were so loud, they have driven him far away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.33,1:14:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你实在应该看那些漫画{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really should read the comics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.34,1:14:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么还有四支？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are four more of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.31,1:14:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,火能吸引那些 能看到热的肉食动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing like a fire to attract every heat-seeking…meat-eater in the valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.71,1:14:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得躲起来 - 到哪去 我已无家可归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to hide. - Where? I have no home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.22,1:14:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,到废物堆积场去 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Junkyard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.16,1:14:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就去废物堆积场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Junkyard! Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.74,1:14:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是怎么去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to get that far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.36,1:14:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,大自然供应一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universe provides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.75,1:14:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想坐船去？- 还有蓝色的防水布 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The universe provides a boat? - And a blue tarp. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.13,1:14:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在它们看到以前进去 快点 来呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your heinies up here before they see us! Now, move! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.22,1:14:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去 用它遮住我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in! Put it over yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.60,1:15:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快遮起来 就象我常说的 有杰克在你们会安然无恙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Like I said, just stick with Jack, you're going to make it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.40,1:15:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,向左 向左 不 是向右 向左 不…向右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, go left. No, no! Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.60,1:15:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要那么多嘛 - 你别变来变去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not that far! Now go right! - Make up your mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.18,1:15:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,向右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, go right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.20,1:15:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the heck…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.67,1:15:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little turd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.81,1:15:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了 够我们躲的了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it! Look! Plenty of places to hide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.44,1:15:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 它没看到我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. It doesn't see us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.21,1:15:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢的离开船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calmly, get out of the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.26,1:15:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静的朝…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And calmly, just head for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.99,1:16:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看到我们了 快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sees us! Shit! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.81,1:16:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它追来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.98,1:16:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.31,1:16:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它到哪儿去了？- 在那里 我可以听到它 我听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's right there, can you hear it? - I hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.50,1:16:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在那里 - 我已经说过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's right there. - That's what I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.50,1:16:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.52,1:17:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是替米格报仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! That one's for Miguel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.52,1:17:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以休息一下吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About time we got a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.53,1:17:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的都来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes the rest of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.95,1:17:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要命 它们看到我们了吗？知道我们在这里吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! Do you think they see us? Do they know we're here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.53,1:17:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.54,1:17:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.54,1:17:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快藏起来 - 可以藏在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cover. We got to find cover. - We can hide in these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.54,1:17:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.17,1:17:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那里去 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.93,1:17:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.55,1:17:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能不能藏在那边？- 没时间啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God, no. Can we hide over there? - No time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.57,1:17:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.57,1:18:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们来估计一下情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's assess the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.28,1:18:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们完蛋了 - 在厕所里完蛋吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're screwed. - We're screwed in an outhouse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.84,1:18:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当初怎么会没拿枪 - 只要一发子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If I had been able to grab just one gun! - Even a single shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.13,1:18:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要在这里待多久 - 几分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long are we stuck here? - Minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.58,1:18:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过几分钟 我们的体温 会让这里象火炉一样发光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our combined heat will make this thing glow to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.59,1:18:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就没命的跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we run! We just run like hell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.76,1:18:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我们跑不到半英里就会被抓到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they fly. We couldn't get haIf a mile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.59,1:18:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,既不能留又不能走 你说该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Can't stay. Can't go. Your turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.60,1:18:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和它们决一死战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to fight them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.10,1:18:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实它们并不聪明 而且只能看到热源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not that smart. They only see heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.76,1:18:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有它们的屁会燃烧 可是这有什么帮助？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They light their farts. How does that help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.22,1:18:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.87,1:18:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们等于是易燃性的化学品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're full of flammable chemicaIs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.62,1:18:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,若让它们吞下热的东西 就能让它们自动燃烧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we ignite them, somehow? Get them to swallow something hot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.94,1:18:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么做呢？- 拿热的东西刺它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - Stick them with something hot, or a fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.63,1:19:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 燃烧的矛 - 可是不能太接近它们 否则会被撕成碎片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A flaming spear. - They'll kill us if we get that close to them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.63,1:19:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好用射的 如果我有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather shoot them, somehow. If I just had my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.64,1:19:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有枪 认了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, you don't have a gun. Deal with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.89,1:19:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洋芋枪 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A potato gun! - A what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.96,1:19:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洋芋枪 - 什么枪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A potato gun! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.65,1:19:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候你从没做过吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you make one as a kid, Burt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.65,1:19:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我把我的BB汽枪 改装成全自动的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I converted my BB gun to full auto…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.65,1:19:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用旧的导管来做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made them from an old pipe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.65,1:19:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把一边封住 放进几滴点火液{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seal up one end, put in a few drops of lighter fluid…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.14,1:19:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把洋芋放进去然后点燃 洋芋能飞一百码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}stick in the potato, light the touchhole. Potato will go a hundred yards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.40,1:19:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是这次 我们放燃烧箭来代替{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only, instead of a potato, we shoot a flaming arrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.34,1:19:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何不可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.67,1:19:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.67,1:19:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们得分头去找材料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Now, of course, we have to do some shopping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.37,1:19:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要导管 任何尺寸都行 做箭的东西 能烧的破布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get some pipe, any size, things for arrows, rags to burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.37,1:19:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要汽油…酒精{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll need something for gasoline. Alcohol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.34,1:19:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不容易 我知道去哪找燃烧液体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This won't be easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.63,1:19:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩去找其他材料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I got a line on flaming liquid. You two, go for parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.50,1:20:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有没有看到屁股开花在附近？- 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see any of these rocket-butts nearby? - No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.69,1:20:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那我们出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? All right, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.69,1:20:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.59,1:22:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,屁股开花 就真让你的屁股开花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ass-Blaster! Blasted your own damn ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.82,1:22:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.82,1:22:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我杀死一支 我真的杀了一支 - 干得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I killed one! I did it! - Way to go, girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.60,1:22:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太高兴 还有三支呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get cocky! That still leaves three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.83,1:22:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我杀了一支{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.85,1:22:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听着 马上就要天黑了 我们找到多少东西了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}listen up, it'll be dark soon. How are we doing, people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.85,1:22:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到一些导管 我找到一些破布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got some pipes. I got some rags.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.85,1:22:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.86,1:22:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有一些箭 - 我们到黄色卡车那儿集合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need some arrows. - Let's meet over at that yellow truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.86,1:22:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我们需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Nestor, we need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.53,1:23:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Nestor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.93,1:23:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特 你吓死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.41,1:23:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克怎么还没回来 - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's taking Jack so long? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.47,1:23:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 你在搞什么？- 够不够？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack! - Is that enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.51,1:23:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.90,1:23:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 现在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.91,1:23:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到那间活动房屋里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move to that mobile home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.52,1:23:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在高地才好发射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It offers high ground for a good line of fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.61,1:23:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.92,1:23:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Jodi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.94,1:24:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁起来 想吃 门儿都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock it! Yeah, eat that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.59,1:24:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真凶呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.37,1:24:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快开始工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.98,1:24:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是属于一个老朋友的 他在第一次突袭蟒攻击中丧生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend, Nestor, was killed in the first graboid incursion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.95,1:24:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 活动房屋就搬到这里来 - 他喜欢喝上两杯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His trailer ended up here. - He loved his shine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.98,1:24:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些弄断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, rip some of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.99,1:25:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,再把一端封起来 还要做个点火孔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you have to seal up one end. Also, make a touchhole to light it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.99,1:25:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有概念了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the concept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.82,1:25:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙随时会撞破屋顶进来 就象在你家一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any minute, this guy will kamikaze through your roof like before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.00,1:25:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要瞄准器 给我胶布或铁丝都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I need a gun sight. Anybody grab any tape or wire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.79,1:25:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的耳环 耳环{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your earrings. Your earrings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.22,1:25:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它拿下来 太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them off. Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.03,1:25:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍旧没有点火孔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still don't have a touchhole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.03,1:25:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有个小孔 可以用吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has a little hole. Will this work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.05,1:26:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,犀利的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armed and dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.06,1:26:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有打火机吗？- 伯特有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But do we have a lighter? - Burt does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.43,1:26:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特有 你怎么知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.91,1:26:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是伯特呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.07,1:26:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,说对啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.97,1:26:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 神风特攻队来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Another kamikaze run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.08,1:26:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把威士忌倒到枪管里 这足够发射好几发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whiskey down the barrel. About a shot's worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.66,1:26:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就在上空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows. He's up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.09,1:26:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,去开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.30,1:26:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,门开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door open!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.10,1:26:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.10,1:26:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在点火吗？- 不 等会儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now? - No, wait for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.67,1:26:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在吗？- 再等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now? - Wait for it. Wait for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.63,1:26:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,点火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.45,1:27:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.29,1:27:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸它个屁滚尿流 真的把它炸…得屁滚尿流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blew him away! I mean, blew him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.81,1:27:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以人类才会在 食物链的最上层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're at the top of the food chain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.99,1:27:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了两个 还剩两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two down, and two to go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.14,1:27:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新装箭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reload.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.15,1:27:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,威士忌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whiskey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.65,1:27:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,装箭 装好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that arrow. Load it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.39,1:27:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.71,1:27:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蹲下来 - 我有个主意 把箭点燃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get down! Stay down! - No! I got an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.55,1:28:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们从另一个天窗中射出去 - 伯特 蹲下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll shoot it through the other skylight. - Stay down, Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.78,1:28:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在呢？- 把你的腿张开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now what? - Spread your legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.17,1:28:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.95,1:28:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我懂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.76,1:28:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没射中可别怪我… - 只要瞄准好就发射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't blame me if I miss because… - Aim and shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.32,1:28:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.19,1:28:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在搞什么鬼 - 我射中它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell did you do? - I shot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.20,1:28:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伯特 - 伯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Burt. - Burt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.66,1:28:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪天我们该一起去打猎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go hunting sometime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.21,1:28:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.75,1:28:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看起来很生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he looks pissed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.22,1:28:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然生气但很笨 一定很容易射中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pissed, but dumb. No sitting duck, Burt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.22,1:28:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不要先做假设{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never assume anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.78,1:29:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一下令就发射 点火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's ready. Stand by to fire at my command. Light me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.00,1:29:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 正如所料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No way! - I knew it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.24,1:29:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们永远在学习之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sons of bitches are always on a learning curve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.16,1:29:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,装箭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.25,1:29:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它进攻啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.24,1:29:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,打火机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.27,1:29:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要打火机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a lighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.28,1:29:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快闪 它要爆炸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to blow! Into the back room, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.29,1:29:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.29,1:30:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 伯特 到这里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go! Get in here, Burt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.62,1:30:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.32,1:30:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 恐怖的经验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.75,1:30:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是二十三点五十九分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-three hours, 59 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.06,1:30:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务完成了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mission completed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.78,1:30:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是阿白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}EI Blanco{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.18,1:30:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么它老是知道我在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! How the hell does he always know where I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.95,1:30:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的表 它会发出超音波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The watch. The uItrasonic signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.36,1:31:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伯特 你没事吧 - 我被卡住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Burt! Are you okay? - I'm caught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.37,1:31:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来了 快把表丢掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt, it's coming! Get rid of the watch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.37,1:31:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 快离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crazy. Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.38,1:31:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿白 既然你想要就过来拿呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}EI Blanco, you want it? Come get it, dude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.07,1:31:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来拿 来呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, buddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.40,1:31:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 工具在我的口袋里 - 老兄 来拿呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Leatherman tool! In my pocket! - Here you go, little buddy, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.40,1:31:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,右边 下排 第三个口袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right side, bottom row, third pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.40,1:32:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把卡在我背心上的铁丝切断 - 要怎么打开它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cut the springs where my vest is snagged. - How do you open this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.42,1:32:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.81,1:32:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.44,1:32:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔蒂 拜托快点 我正在努力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jodi, hurry it up! I'm working on it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.77,1:32:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.45,1:32:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你快走 走呀 - 伯特 你闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of here. Go on! - Shut up, Burt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.64,1:33:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.56,1:33:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.49,1:33:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,全能的神呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God Almighty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.52,1:33:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,投得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good throw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.53,1:34:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的旋转肌腱出毛病以前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to pitch a little single A ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.05,1:34:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾是小联盟的投手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}till the old rotator cuff started acting up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.41,1:34:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然机会不大 但阿白有可能会回来吃第二顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the off-chance that EI Blanco's coming back for seconds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.34,1:34:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我离开这里好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}want to get me off this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.65,1:34:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.57,1:34:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你等一下好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you hold on for just a minute?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.58,1:34:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们出价跟你一样高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They matched your offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.58,1:34:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 这可是世界仅有的屁股开花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry. This is the world's only living Ass-Blaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.22,1:34:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还得供女儿上大学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have a daughter to put through school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.59,1:35:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要部车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.60,1:35:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you hold a minute?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.15,1:35:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斯维加斯的人出价更高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Vegas guys went even higher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.98,1:35:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要接受？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.93,1:35:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,齐格飞与罗伊 我们决定卖给你们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Siegfried, Roy, he's all yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.61,1:35:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住要待在绳子后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you stay behind the ropes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.94,1:35:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 沙漠杰克 要走了吗？- 看来恐怕会变成洗车杰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hitting the road, Desert Jack? - Well, more like, Car Wash Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.64,1:35:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,自然界供应一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universe provides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.64,1:35:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恭喜啦 - 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Congratulations. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.64,1:35:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你仍会在这附近 对 我喜欢这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I guess you'll be sticking around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.97,1:36:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它提供许多资源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I like the area. It has a lot to offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.65,1:36:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车加了个新后轴 我带你去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, I'm breaking in my new rear axle. You want to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.79,1:36:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 试车？- 我正忙着装货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- go for a little ride? - I'm restocking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.89,1:36:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的云很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice clouds out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.15,1:36:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就可以看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see the clouds from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.67,1:36:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是到那里看更好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but these… See, these are the good ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.68,1:36:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.18,1:36:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏蒂 你帮我看一下店好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy? Can you watch the store?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.71,1:37:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It figures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.71,1:37:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,成熟女人的魅力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Older women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.25,1:37:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿白先生 下午好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buenas tardes, Senor Blanco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.38,1:37:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖 跟着车子走就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, just follow the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.65,1:37:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.30,1:37:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好车 我一直在等你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, nice wheels. I've been expecting you, Melvin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.10,1:37:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个顽固的抢钱一族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are one persistent little money-grubber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.89,1:37:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样嘛 你看看 这里什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Burt. Look around, man. There's nothing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.25,1:37:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要改变它 好让更多的家庭搬过来住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to turn this into something. I'll build homes for families.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.76,1:37:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你最好趁机高价卖出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The smart thing for you to do is cash in right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.77,1:38:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你最好到我这边来 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You might want to join me, Melvin. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.71,1:38:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边比较安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's safer up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.78,1:38:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀 我以为你把它们全杀光了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, Burt! I thought you killed all those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.73,1:38:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可没这么说 - 快杀它呀 炸死它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I never said that. - God, man, kill it! Blow it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.79,1:38:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在等什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.65,1:38:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是只要它存在一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, as long as one of these reptilians is still alive…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.45,1:38:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这整个区域就是被保护区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this whole area is deemed protected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.80,1:38:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是根据濒临绝种动物法中 第1472-B条款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, pursuant to section 1472-B of the Endangered Species Act?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.36,1:38:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,换句话说 不准建房子 公寓或是牧场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In other words, no houses, no condos and no ranchettes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.81,1:38:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了 这家伙会吃掉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crazy. Okay? These things, man, they're going to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.29,1:38:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把你们全部吃光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to eat you, Burt. They're going to get all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.04,1:38:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有地下监视器 突袭蟒路障和各种保护措施{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got new geophones, graboid barriers, blanket protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.23,1:38:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且全镇都同意 若在你和阿白中间做选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole town agrees. Between you and EI Blanco, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.24,1:38:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都选择阿白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll take him every time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.77,1:39:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见啦 马文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adi, Melvin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.57,1:39:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.95,1:39:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.85,1:39:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.36,1:39:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burt! You asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.84,1:39:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个笨杂种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You damn son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.85,1:39:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你 恨你的枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! I hate you! I hate your guts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.85,1:39:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个寒酸 有病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sorry, sick…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.01,1:39:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,狂妄…右翼 观念狭隘…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}paranoid, right-wing…redneck psycho!{\r}
